Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:08:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/22] =?UTF-8?q?fix(security):=20hardening=20batch=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20origins,=20master=20key,=20IP=20guard,=20formula=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?cells,=20NUL,=20bootstrap=20secret,=20STT,=20LDAP=20prune,=20sc?=
 =?UTF-8?q?hedules,=20session=20ownership,=20SSRF,=20default-model=20gate?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

One MR of independent, individually small fixes from the review (2.13).

- B-19 Loopback and RFC1918 http origins passed CSRF/CORS in every
  environment; now development only, production accepts FRONTEND_URL.
- B-29 Gateway master key compared with ==; now secrets.compare_digest and
  an empty configured key never matches.
- #17 admin_ip_guard let requests through when the DB was down and no
  policy was cached (enforce silently became off); now 503.
- #23 Chat->XLSX export wrote model text into cells verbatim; cells that
  start with = + - @ (and tab/CR) get an apostrophe.
- #24 update_last_session_message (streaming) stored NUL and unbounded
  content; now strip_nul + truncation to the same 512 KiB ceiling as append.
- #25 The bootstrap admin password went into the container log; it now goes
  to <tls_state_dir>/bootstrap-admin.txt (0600), the log carries only the
  marker and path, and stack.sh prints the file once and removes it.
- #27 GET /api/chat/models and GET /api/admin/models executed
  DELETE FROM ai_models; GETs no longer write (delete_connection covers it).
- B-27/B-28 STT temp-file suffix from a fixed audio whitelist; WAV header
  sanity (8 kHz-192 kHz, 1-8 ch, 8/16/24/32/64 bit) so a crafted fmt chunk
  cannot inflate billable seconds.
- B-15 LDAP prune refuses an empty directory answer or removing more than
  LDAP_PRUNE_MAX_RATIO (0.5) of known LDAP users in one run; result carries
  prune_reason.
- #14 Report schedules (admin and self-service) validate report_type,
  5-field cron (APScheduler), recipient addresses, format and JSON params;
  self-service may only target the caller's own email.
- B-26 chat_session_id in attachments/voice/attach-from-media must be the
  caller's own session or a project session they can write in; else 404.
- B-30 Connection base_url passes the SSRF guard on create/patch.
- #16 OIDC: discovery URL and every endpoint the discovery document names
  (token, jwks, userinfo, end_session) must be https and pass the SSRF
  guard before use; no redirects, no proxy env.
- B-20 system_default_models._assert_usable requires a live connection with
  an API key, matching the transcription gate.
- #22 resolve_model_and_key joins connections and filters is_active in the
  query, so a disabled twin no longer shadows an active model.
- #18 Code-interpreter capacity subject for a gateway key is its owner
  user, so one person with N keys gets one share.
- Production guard flags ALLOW_INSECURE_SAML.
- The test-only onelogin shim no longer overwrites attributes of the real
  python3-saml modules (it broke SAML tests that ran after it).

Tests: tests/test_security_hardening_batch.py (12), bootstrap log test
rewritten; full backend suite 1353 passed.

